{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0701", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "提问", "display_form": "提问", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 701, "pronunciation": "tíwèn"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "ask a question", "secondary_glosses": ["ask questions", "raise a question"], "notes": "Used when you ask a teacher, speaker, or another person a question."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0701-ex1", "meaning_en": "ask questions", "sentence": "老师说完了，大家可以提问。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0701-ex2", "meaning_en": "ask a question", "sentence": "有问题就马上提问吧。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0701-ex3", "meaning_en": "raise a question", "sentence": "开会的时候，他先听，最后再提问。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0701-ex1", "translation": "After the teacher finishes speaking, everyone can ask questions."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0701-ex2", "translation": "If you have a question, ask it right away."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0701-ex3", "translation": "During the meeting, he listens first and asks questions at the end."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0702", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "题目", "display_form": "题目", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 702, "pronunciation": "tímù"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "question; topic", "secondary_glosses": ["exercise question", "title"], "notes": "Often used for a question in homework or a test, and also for the topic or title of a piece of writing."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0702-ex1", "meaning_en": "exercise question", "sentence": "这个题目我不会做。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0702-ex2", "meaning_en": "question", "sentence": "老师把题目写在黑板上。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0702-ex3", "meaning_en": "title", "sentence": "这个故事的题目很有意思。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0702-ex1", "translation": "I do not know how to do this question."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0702-ex2", "translation": "The teacher wrote the question on the blackboard."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0702-ex3", "translation": "The title of this story is very interesting."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0703", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "体会", "display_form": "体会", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 703, "pronunciation": "tǐhuì"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "realize from experience", "secondary_glosses": ["understand through experience", "personal understanding"], "notes": "Can be a verb for coming to understand something by living it, and a noun for the understanding that comes from that experience."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0703-ex1", "meaning_en": "realize from experience", "sentence": "工作以后，我才体会到休息很重要。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0703-ex2", "meaning_en": "understand through experience", "sentence": "自己做饭以后，她体会到妈妈不容易。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0703-ex3", "meaning_en": "personal understanding", "sentence": "看完这本书，我有很多体会。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0703-ex1", "translation": "Only after I started working did I realize that rest is very important."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0703-ex2", "translation": "After cooking by herself, she realized how hard things are for her mother."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0703-ex3", "translation": "After finishing this book, I had a lot to reflect on."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0704", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "体现", "display_form": "体现", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 704, "pronunciation": "tǐxiàn"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "show; reflect", "secondary_glosses": ["reveal", "embody"], "notes": "Used when an action, detail, or object shows a quality, feeling, or idea."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0704-ex1", "meaning_en": "show", "sentence": "这张照片体现了孩子的快乐。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0704-ex2", "meaning_en": "show", "sentence": "这份礼物体现了他的关心。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0704-ex3", "meaning_en": "show", "sentence": "干净的教室体现了大家的认真。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0704-ex1", "translation": "This photo shows the child's happiness."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0704-ex2", "translation": "This gift shows his care."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0704-ex3", "translation": "The clean classroom shows how serious everyone is."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0705", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "体验", "display_form": "体验", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 705, "pronunciation": "tǐyàn"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "experience; try out", "secondary_glosses": ["get a feel for"], "notes": "Used when you personally do something to feel what it is like."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0705-ex1", "meaning_en": "experience", "sentence": "下个月我们去农村体验生活。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0705-ex2", "meaning_en": "try out", "sentence": "我想先体验一下这份工作。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0705-ex3", "meaning_en": "experience", "sentence": "这次体验很有意思。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0705-ex1", "translation": "Next month we will go to the countryside to experience life there."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0705-ex2", "translation": "I want to try out this job first."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0705-ex3", "translation": "This experience was very interesting."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0706", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "天空", "display_form": "天空", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 706, "pronunciation": "tiānkōng"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "sky", "secondary_glosses": [], "notes": "The wide open sky above you."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0706-ex1", "meaning_en": "sky", "sentence": "雨后的天空特别蓝。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0706-ex2", "meaning_en": "sky", "sentence": "孩子一直看天空。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0706-ex3", "meaning_en": "sky", "sentence": "晚上的天空有很多星星。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0706-ex1", "translation": "The sky is especially blue after the rain."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0706-ex2", "translation": "The child keeps looking at the sky."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0706-ex3", "translation": "There are many stars in the night sky."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0707", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "甜", "display_form": "甜", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 707, "pronunciation": "tián"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "sweet", "secondary_glosses": ["sweet-tasting", "sweet-looking"], "notes": "Usually describes sweet food or drink, and it can also describe a sweet smile or expression."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0707-ex1", "meaning_en": "sweet", "sentence": "这个苹果很甜。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0707-ex2", "meaning_en": "sweet", "sentence": "这杯奶茶太甜了。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0707-ex3", "meaning_en": "sweet", "sentence": "她的笑很甜。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0707-ex1", "translation": "This apple is very sweet."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0707-ex2", "translation": "This cup of milk tea is too sweet."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0707-ex3", "translation": "Her smile is very sweet."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0708", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "调", "display_form": "调", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 708, "pronunciation": "tiáo"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "adjust; set", "secondary_glosses": ["turn up/down", "tune"], "notes": "Used for changing a setting such as sound, temperature, or time."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0708-ex1", "meaning_en": "adjust", "sentence": "请把声音调小一点。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0708-ex2", "meaning_en": "tune", "sentence": "他把电视调好了。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0708-ex3", "meaning_en": "adjust", "sentence": "天热了，把空调调低一点。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0708-ex1", "translation": "Please turn the volume down a little."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0708-ex2", "translation": "He adjusted the TV and got it right."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0708-ex3", "translation": "It is hot, so turn the air conditioner a little lower."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0709", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "调整", "display_form": "调整", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 709, "pronunciation": "tiáozhěng"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "adjust", "secondary_glosses": ["readjust", "make changes to"], "notes": "Used for changing a plan, time, seat, or other arrangement so it works better."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0709-ex1", "meaning_en": "adjust", "sentence": "公司调整了工作时间。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0709-ex2", "meaning_en": "adjust", "sentence": "老师让我们调整座位。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0709-ex3", "meaning_en": "adjust", "sentence": "我们要调整计划。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0709-ex1", "translation": "The company adjusted the working hours."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0709-ex2", "translation": "The teacher asked us to change seats."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0709-ex3", "translation": "We need to adjust the plan."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0710", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "跳", "display_form": "跳", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 710, "pronunciation": "tiào"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "jump", "secondary_glosses": ["hop", "skip"], "notes": "Used for jumping with the body, and also for skipping over something."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0710-ex1", "meaning_en": "jump", "sentence": "孩子一听到音乐就跳起来了。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0710-ex2", "meaning_en": "jump", "sentence": "小猫从桌子上跳下来。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0710-ex3", "meaning_en": "skip", "sentence": "这个题太难，我们先跳过去。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0710-ex1", "translation": "As soon as the child heard the music, he jumped up."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0710-ex2", "translation": "The kitten jumped down from the table."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0710-ex3", "translation": "This question is too hard, so let's skip it for now."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0711", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "跳高", "display_form": "跳高", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 711, "pronunciation": "tiào gāo"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "high jump", "secondary_glosses": [], "notes": "The track-and-field event where you jump over a high bar."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0711-ex1", "meaning_en": "high jump", "sentence": "他最喜欢的运动是跳高。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0711-ex2", "meaning_en": "high jump", "sentence": "学校下个月有跳高比赛。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0711-ex3", "meaning_en": "high jump", "sentence": "哥哥昨天跳高得了第一。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0711-ex1", "translation": "His favorite sport is the high jump."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0711-ex2", "translation": "The school has a high-jump competition next month."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0711-ex3", "translation": "My older brother won first place in the high jump yesterday."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0712", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "跳舞", "display_form": "跳舞", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 712, "pronunciation": "tiàowǔ"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "dance", "secondary_glosses": [], "notes": "To dance, often to music."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0712-ex1", "meaning_en": "dance", "sentence": "晚饭后，她常去广场跳舞。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0712-ex2", "meaning_en": "dance", "sentence": "音乐一响，孩子们就开始跳舞。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0712-ex3", "meaning_en": "dance", "sentence": "姐姐学了两年，还很喜欢跳舞。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0712-ex1", "translation": "After dinner, she often goes to the square to dance."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0712-ex2", "translation": "As soon as the music starts, the children begin to dance."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0712-ex3", "translation": "My older sister has studied dance for two years and still really likes dancing."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0713", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "跳远", "display_form": "跳远", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 713, "pronunciation": "tiào yuǎn"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "long jump", "secondary_glosses": [], "notes": "The track-and-field event where you jump as far as possible."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0713-ex1", "meaning_en": "long jump", "sentence": "他在运动会上参加了跳远。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0713-ex2", "meaning_en": "long jump", "sentence": "跳远比赛下午开始。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0713-ex3", "meaning_en": "long jump", "sentence": "哥哥这次跳远跳得很远。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0713-ex1", "translation": "He took part in the long jump at the sports meet."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0713-ex2", "translation": "The long-jump competition starts in the afternoon."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0713-ex3", "translation": "My older brother jumped very far in the long jump this time."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0714", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "铁", "display_form": "铁", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 714, "pronunciation": "tiě"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "iron", "secondary_glosses": ["made of iron"], "notes": "Can mean the metal iron itself or something made from it."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0714-ex1", "meaning_en": "made of iron", "sentence": "这把刀是铁的。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0714-ex2", "meaning_en": "made of iron", "sentence": "这个门是铁的。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0714-ex3", "meaning_en": "iron", "sentence": "这种桌子是铁做的。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0714-ex1", "translation": "This knife is made of iron."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0714-ex2", "translation": "This door is made of iron."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0714-ex3", "translation": "This kind of table is made of iron."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0715", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "铁路", "display_form": "铁路", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 715, "pronunciation": "tiě lù"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "railway", "secondary_glosses": ["railroad"], "notes": "The track and rail system that trains run on."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0715-ex1", "meaning_en": "railway", "sentence": "这条铁路通到北京。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0715-ex2", "meaning_en": "railway", "sentence": "火车正在铁路上开。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0715-ex3", "meaning_en": "railway", "sentence": "爸爸在铁路边工作。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0715-ex1", "translation": "This railway goes to Beijing."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0715-ex2", "translation": "The train is running on the railway."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0715-ex3", "translation": "Dad works by the railway."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0716", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "听力", "display_form": "听力", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 716, "pronunciation": "tīng lì"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "listening ability", "secondary_glosses": ["listening comprehension", "hearing"], "notes": "Often used for language-study listening skills, and sometimes for hearing ability in general."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0716-ex1", "meaning_en": "listening ability", "sentence": "我的听力不太好。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0716-ex2", "meaning_en": "listening comprehension", "sentence": "老师说这次听力有点难。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0716-ex3", "meaning_en": "listening ability", "sentence": "每天听中文，可以练听力。", "difficulty": 1, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0716-ex1", "translation": "My listening ability is not very good."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0716-ex2", "translation": "The teacher said this listening exercise is a little hard."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0716-ex3", "translation": "Listening to Chinese every day can train your listening ability."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-3-0717", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "听众", "display_form": "听众", "pos": "unknown", "rank": 717, "pronunciation": "tīng zhòng"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "audience", "secondary_glosses": ["listeners"], "notes": "The people listening to a speech, show, program, or speaker."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-3-0717-ex1", "meaning_en": "audience", "sentence": "台下的听众都在看他。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0717-ex2", "meaning_en": "listeners", "sentence": "这位主持人有很多听众。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-3-0717-ex3", "meaning_en": "audience", "sentence": "听众听完以后开始提问。", "difficulty": 2, "source": "generator-3", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0717-ex1", "translation": "Everyone in the audience is watching him."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0717-ex2", "translation": "This host has a lot of listeners."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-3-0717-ex3", "translation": "After listening, the audience began to ask questions."}]}
